"article8": {
    "title": "Behind the scenes at NORA",
    "hero": {
      "headline": "Behind the scenes at NORA",
      "subtitle": "A little behind-the-scenes magic... <br/><br/> There's something pretty special about Online Retailer week. <br/> <br/> For a few days, thousands of people from across Australia's retail and ecommerce community come together to share ideas, challenge one another, celebrate successes and reconnect with familiar faces.",
      "byline": "By Gareth Lewis",
      "meta": "08 SEP 2026 • 2 MIN READ",
      "heroImage": "behind-the-scenes-tall.jpg"
    },
    "sections": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "t NORA, it’s one of our favourite times of the year. Not simply because of the events themselves, but because of the conversations they create. After years of bringing this community together, it’s a privilege to hear leaders openly share what’s working, what’s difficult and what’s next.",
        "dropCap": "A"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "It’s also a big few days for the NORA team."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Between our Digital Retail Leaders Roundtable, Leaders Breakfast, podcast studio and everything happening across Online Retailer, it was a busy and exhilarating few days, with the energy that comes from having so much of the industry together in one place."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "And somewhere in the middle of it all, there was a little unexpected magic."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "As we headed onto the Online Retailer expo floor to meet Mal Chia and the team, Australian magician Jackson Aces stopped us in our tracks with an impossible card trick."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "A card with my name on it, written in someone else’s handwriting, appeared from a wallet."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "A few minutes later, he drew a symbol on his own hand, only for it to somehow appear on mine."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "We still have no idea how he did it."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "It was one of those wonderfully unexpected moments that made everyone stop, laugh and simply enjoy being there."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "A little moment of wonder in the middle of a very busy week."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Thank you, Jackson, for reminding us that sometimes the smallest, most unexpected moments are the ones we remember longest."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Here’s to finding a little magic in your day."
      }
    ]
  },